+<p>Rent the measurement kit until the <strong>ten-job design hurdle</strong>, and make the integrator buy guards, sensors or redesign. Do not buy a cell, van or permanent test kit to create demand. The €15,000 year-one hurdle remains below the reader's €50,000 risk ceiling.</p>
